Overview. First, we provide a high-level overview of Conditional Diffusion Sampling (CDS), our framework for sampling from unnormalized multimodal distributions. The central idea of CDS is to reduce a difficult global sampling problem into two manageable stages. We condition on a reference point z ∼ ν ref z\sim{
u_{	ext{ref}}} and construct a conditional path of distributions { ν t | z } t ∈ ( 0 , 1 ] \{
u_{t\mid z}\}_{t\in(0,1]} that gradually evolves from a point mass at z z to the full target distribution ν 
u . The path is defined via a Conditional Interpolant map F t | z F_{t\mid z} (defined in Subsec. 3.1 ), which allows us to derive closed-form transport dynamics that need a careful initialization. As illustrated in Fig. 1 , our sampling procedure leverages this in two stages: Stage 1: Conditional Sampling ( Subsec. 3.3 ). We initialize the process at a small time t 0 > 0 t_{0}>0 by sampling x t 0 ∼ ν t 0 | z x_{t_{0}}\sim
u_{t_{0}\mid z} . As illustrated in Fig. 3 , ν t 0 | z 
u_{t_{0}\mid z} highly concentrates around z z , ensuring substantial overlap with the reference distribution ν ref {
u_{	ext{ref}}} , and making global exploration highly efficient. In practice, using Parallel Tempering (PT) to sample ν t 0 | z 
u_{t_{0}\mid z} yields improved swap efficiency and mode exploration, see Subsec. 5.1 . Stage 2: SDE Integration ( Subsec. 3.2 ). We transport the approximate samples from ν t 0 | z 
u_{t_{0}\mid z} to the target ν 
u at t = 1 t=1 . Because the interpolant dynamics admit a closed-form SDE, we can transport and refine these samples without any approximation. Crucially, the SDE provides continuous refinement, correcting samples along the trajectory, see Subsec. 5.2 . The remainder of this section details each component: Subsec. 3.1 introduces Conditional Interpolants, Subsec. 3.2 derives their transport dynamics (Stage 2), Subsec. 3.3 analyzes the initialization (Stage 1), and Subsec. 3.4 presents the full algorithm. Notably, Stage 2 is presented before Stage 1, as the derivation of the transport dynamics clarify the need for careful initialization.

